[{"id":"CN-IP-006","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["/31","点到点"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/"}],"articleIndex":6,"articleCount":17,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>/31 为什么在点到点链路上可以使用两个地址？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>RFC 3021 为点到点链路定义特殊语义，使两个地址分别表示链路两端。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>普通广播 LAN 要把网络地址和广播地址从主机地址中排除，所以 \u003ccode>/31\u003c/code> 不能直接当作所有二进制子网的通用答案。RFC 3021 为点到点链路定义了特殊语义：两个地址分别代表链路两端，不需要传统的网络/广播地址。使用前仍要确认设备、操作系统和路由协议支持，并在规划和配置中明确这是点到点链路，而不是普通 LAN。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-NET-002","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["OSI","TCP/IP","分层"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>OSI 七层模型和 TCP/IP 分层模型应该怎样使用？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>把它们当作定位职责和边界的抽象，不要把现实协议机械地一一塞进唯一层。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>OSI 是帮助划分职责的七层参考模型，TCP/IP 则把真实互联网中常用的链路、网际、传输和应用协议组织在一起；两者不是必须逐层一一对应的两套实现。排障时先说观察对象，再用模型解释它依赖的边界：看到 Ethernet 帧只能说明链路层，看到 TCP 握手也还没有证明 HTTP 业务成功。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>可以按用途选择模型：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>使用场景\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>更有帮助的表达\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>例子\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>解释职责和故障边界\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>OSI 层次\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>说明问题在链路、网络还是传输\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>对照实际协议栈\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>TCP/IP 分层\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>IP、TCP/QUIC、HTTP/TLS 的组合\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>现场排障\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>现象 + 分层证据\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>把抓包字段和服务响应按时间线对齐\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-HTTP-001","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","资源","表示"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>HTTP 中资源、表示和消息分别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>资源是请求目标概念，表示是资源在某时刻以某种媒体类型呈现的数据，消息是承载 HTTP 语义、字段和内容的协议载体。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>资源是被请求的对象或概念，例如订单集合 \u003ccode>/items\u003c/code>；表示是描述该资源的一种具体字节形式，例如 JSON、HTML、某种语言或编码；消息则是承载请求/响应语义的信封，包含起始行、字段和内容。一个资源可以有多个表示，客户端通过 \u003ccode>Accept\u003c/code> 等字段表达偏好，服务器用 \u003ccode>Content-Type\u003c/code> 说明实际返回的表示。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight http\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">GET\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">/items\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"meta\">HTTP/1.1\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"attribute\">Accept\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"punctuation\">: \u003c/span>application/json\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"language-http\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">HTTP/1.1\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">200\u003c/span> OK\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"language-http\">\u003cspan class=\"attribute\">Content-Type\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"punctuation\">: \u003c/span>application/json\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"language-http\">\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"language-http\">\u003cspan class=\"language-css\">\u003cspan class=\"selector-attr\">[&#123;\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;id&quot;\u003c/span>: 1&#125;]\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>这里 \u003ccode>/items\u003c/code> 是资源，JSON 数组是表示，整个请求和响应分别是消息。旧资料中的“实体”应放回内容/表示语境；HTTP/2/3 改变线格式，不改变这些方法、状态、字段和内容语义。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-ADV-FAQ-003","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["IPsec","HTTPS","安全边界"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(八)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(八)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/e470b049/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(八)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(八)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/e470b049/"}],"articleIndex":8,"articleCount":9,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>IPsec 和 HTTPS 需要同时使用吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它们保护的边界不同，是否叠加取决于网络拓扑和威胁模型。IPsec 可以保护网络路径，HTTPS 保护应用连接。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>IPsec 隧道建立也不替代 HTTP 认证与授权；“链路加密”与“应用身份”不是同一个结论。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>先标出保护边界：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>技术\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>主要保护\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>仍需单独验证\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>IPsec\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>网络路径/隧道\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>应用认证与授权\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>HTTPS\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>应用连接到 TLS 终止点\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>终止点之后的内部链路\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>是否叠加取决于拓扑和威胁模型，不是“加密越多越安全”的抽象竞赛。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-09-redo-undo-binlog-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["redo","undo","binlog","崩溃恢复"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(九)InnoDB与日志.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(九)InnoDB与日志","articlePath":"posts/b67bacc6/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(九)InnoDB与日志.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(九)InnoDB与日志","articlePath":"posts/b67bacc6/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":1,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>redo、undo、binlog 分别解决什么问题？如何用一个隔离实验证明提交后的数据具备恢复证据？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">12\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">13\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">14\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">15\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CREATE TABLE\u003c/span> recovery_probe (\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  id \u003cspan class=\"type\">BIGINT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">PRIMARY KEY\u003c/span>,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">value\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"type\">INT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT NULL\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">) ENGINE \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> InnoDB;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">INSERT INTO\u003c/span> recovery_probe \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">VALUES\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"number\">10\u003c/span>);\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">START\u003c/span> TRANSACTION;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">UPDATE\u003c/span> recovery_probe \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SET\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">value\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">11\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">COMMIT\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">value\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> recovery_probe \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SHOW\u003c/span> VARIABLES \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">LIKE\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit&#x27;\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SHOW\u003c/span> VARIABLES \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">LIKE\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;sync_binlog&#x27;\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SHOW\u003c/span> ENGINE INNODB STATUS;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SHOW\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"type\">BINARY\u003c/span> LOGS;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>三类日志可以沿着一次 \u003ccode>UPDATE\u003c/code> 的生命周期区分：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>组件\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>主要内容\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>解决的问题\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>redo\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>页的持久化变化\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>崩溃后把已提交变化重做到数据页\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>undo\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>旧版本与回滚信息\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>撤销未提交修改、支持一致性读\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>binlog\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>服务器级逻辑事件\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>复制和时间点恢复\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>实验里 \u003ccode>SELECT\u003c/code> 得到 \u003ccode>11\u003c/code> 只能证明当前实例读到了新值；还要记录 \u003ccode>innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>sync_binlog\u003c/code>、InnoDB 状态和 binlog，再在隔离实例执行重启/恢复演练。\u003ccode>SHOW BINARY LOGS\u003c/code> 需要权限，转储和日志可能含敏感业务数据，不能把探针表或日志操作直接搬到生产。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-locator-strict","type":"choice","priority":1,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["Locator","严格模式"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(三)页面元素定位.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(三)页面元素定位","articlePath":"posts/d5972197/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(三)页面元素定位.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(三)页面元素定位","articlePath":"posts/d5972197/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>两个订单行都有“删除”按钮，哪种定位最合适？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先按业务身份缩小容器，再定位操作目标，可以消除歧义并保留测试意图。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>先定位业务容器，再在容器内定位动作：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">row = page.get_by_role(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;row&quot;\u003c/span>, name=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;订单 A-1001&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">row.get_by_role(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;button&quot;\u003c/span>, name=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;删除&quot;\u003c/span>).click()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>这样严格模式要求的唯一匹配是业务上的唯一订单，而不是页面上第一个删除按钮。first 或长 CSS 链虽然可能让测试变绿，却会掩盖错误行被操作的风险。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>直接使用第一个删除按钮\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>使用全页面长 CSS 链\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>先定位目标订单行，再在行内定位删除按钮\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"playwright-trace-purpose","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["TraceViewer","调试"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十)调试与交付.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十)调试与交付","articlePath":"posts/23096463/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十)调试与交付.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十)调试与交付","articlePath":"posts/23096463/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/8141684d/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Trace Viewer 最适合回答什么问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>测试执行了什么，以及浏览器在每一步观察到什么。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Trace 将 Action、DOM 快照、网络、Console 和源码关联起来，适合重建失败因果；业务正确仍需明确断言和需求合同。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>Trace 的价值在于把动作和观察结果放到同一时间线上：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>材料\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>回答什么\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Action\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>测试当时执行了什么\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>DOM 快照\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>页面在该步呈现什么\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Network/Console\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>依赖和浏览器报告了什么\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Source\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>具体代码路径\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-upload-journey","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","上传","权限"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/"}],"articleIndex":13,"articleCount":14,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>如何测试文件上传的完整流程？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>从输入约束到上传、预览、下载、删除和恢复建立生命周期用例，并核对内容完整性、权限与临时资源。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>固定允许类型和大小，覆盖合法、超限、错误类型、断线恢复、重复上传、删除后访问和切换用户可见范围。上传后下载字节应与原文件一致；删除后不能访问且临时分片清理；多文件部分成功和刷新继续是追问。预期写状态和文件 ID，不只写进度条到 100%。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]